Error [E0204]: `values` is already shared in this call, so it can't be changed here too
  --> implicit_borrows_persist_but_finished_scalar_reads_do_not.jet:5:32
    |
  5 |     inspect_then_edit(values, &values)
    |                                ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being looked at, nobody else may be changing it
 Fix: Drop the extra use of `values`, or copy first with `~values`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
